  "raw": "<!DOCTYPE html\n\tPUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\"\n\t \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">\n<head>\n<title>Medium data</title>\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n</head>\n<body bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n<!-- Global site tag (gtag.js) - Google Analytics -->\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-49139209-3\"></script>\n<script>\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  gtag('js', new Date());\n  gtag('config', 'UA-49139209-3');\n</script>\n\n\n<H1>Medium data</H1>\nSearch for medium no. = [1084].\n<HR>\nUnless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.\n<HR>\n<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1084&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;THIOBACILLUS PROSPERUS MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>\n<TABLE BORDER>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.33&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.75&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;3.45&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl                                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.14&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.14&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> K<sub>2</sub>HPO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.14&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NiCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace mineral solution (see below)                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;940.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>\n</TABLE>\nAdjust pH to 2.5 and autoclave.  After cooling, aseptically add the following solution (filter-sterilized):  <br>\n<TABLE BORDER>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O solution (see below)            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;50.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>\n</TABLE>\n<I>Trace mineral solution:</I> <br>\n<TABLE BORDER>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace minerals (see Medium No. <a href=\"/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=151\">151</a>)                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NiCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.03&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g   </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>SeO<sub>3</sub>&#183;5H<sub>2</sub>O                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>\n<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaWO<sub>4</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>\n</TABLE>\n<I>FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O solution:</I> <br>\nDissolve 40.0 g FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O in 0.1 N H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> solution and fill up to  100.0 ml.  Filter-sterilize and store under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere.       <br>\n       <br>\n<HR>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">Copyright &copy; 2026 Microbe Division (JCM) - All Rights Reserved</div>\n\n</BODY>\n\n</HTML>"
